      "writtenOn": "2026-11-03T16:56:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this is a real case where SPDM inventory mapping doesn\u0027t work today. When GPUs sit behind a USB MCTP bridge and support SPDM, EM has an entry for each GPU, but their endpoints have no configured_by, so the SPDM daemon can\u0027t tell which GPU is which.",
      "revId": "6f2056d979eaecacc535cdf0b7214fa9847cd32f",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
    },
