      "writtenOn": "2026-11-04T03:59:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It would it help if it is made explicit between section `Design abstract` and the current section, that the Peripheral Board EM config of type `Port` would define set of Contacts present on Peripheral Board and for a BMC Board to support connecting to that Peripheral Board, BMC Board EM Config of type `Port` should also define same set of Contacts, with `Name` property of both board\u0027s `Port` config has to be equal and `Contacts` each array element\u0027s `Name` and `Protocol` properties has to be equal.",
